<section style="padding:3rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)"><div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Why Partner with SDF Clothing?</h2><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Yarn sourcing runs through our own mill relationships, with yarn count, ply, and spinning method — ring-spun or open-end — specified to match your fabric's intended hand feel and durability rather than defaulting to whatever a subcontracted knitter already has in stock. GOTS, OEKO-TEX Standard 100, BSCI, WRAP, and ISO 9001 certification apply.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Ring-spun yarn produces a softer, more durable fabric suited to premium jersey and fine-gauge knits; open-end yarn costs less and suits heavier, more casual fabrics — a real trade-off we discuss with you rather than defaulting to whichever is cheaper for us. Minimum order is 300 pieces per style, with yarn sourcing, knitting, and export documentation included.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Yarn-level sourcing decisions still carry Bangladesh's full trade position downstream: EU duty-free access under Everything But Arms through November 2029 despite LDC graduation in November 2026, and a 20% US tariff cap from late 2025 that keeps finished-garment landed cost below Chinese-sourced alternatives facing Section 301 duties.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem">Ready to start? <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--color-primary)">Request a sample</a> or <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--color-primary)">contact our team</a> for a detailed FOB quote within 48 hours.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>

